# Technical Highlights
body[1]{content}:
  "This week, Pharos reached a performance milestone: the transition to a parallelized data engine. For the designer, this means near-zero latency when searching the registry. Our new 'Temporal Warden' technology monitors every lookup, ensuring that even complex equipment dialects never freeze your workspace, maintaining 100ms responsiveness as a hard standard."

# Performance Telemetry
metrics[3]{metric, value, unit}:
  JIT Latency (Avg), 12, ms
  CI Verification Time, -60, %
  WASM Payload Reduction, 33, %

# Delivered Capabilities
features[3]{feature, status, impact}:
  Parallelized JIT Engine, Complete, High
  CI/CD Sharding, Complete, High
  SHA-256 Lazy Shard Loader, Complete, Medium
